        <mxCell id="note-sel" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#6B7A88;line-height:1.55;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#8A5A00;&quot;&gt;P2 / stride 4 is teacher-only.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It participates fully in teacher detection, but the student has no stride-4 level — so stride matching &lt;b&gt;drops&lt;/b&gt; it here instead of blindly pairing it with the student's P3.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ProjectionLayers also asserts the level count, so a 4-vs-3 mismatch raises instead of truncating.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FFFDF5;strokeColor=#E0C88A;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
