        <mxCell id="note-removed" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#6B7A88;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#8E2F2F;&quot;&gt;Removed by fusion-redesign:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;StageAttentionFusion / CrossModalFusion (−9.42M) · DualConvNeXtBackbone (two stems, two forward passes) · DualFPN (−3.13M) · attention_maps output key. There is no cross-attention and no RGB/NIR feature stream after the input concatenation.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5DBE1;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
